00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.240
Wow...!

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:41.750
Winter had come, and Ronja's forest had transformed into a forest of ice.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.160
It was hard to believe how beautiful it looked.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:49.690
One day, when it had snowed much more than usual,

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:54.470
Ronja ventured into the forest and became stuck there,

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:58.270
as her foot had gotten wedged into a Rumphobs snow hole.

