00:14:16.050 --> 00:14:20.090
I'll see if I can get you free.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:49.750
Just a little bit...

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:51.520
Uh-huh.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.330
