00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:35.120
Hey, stop whining.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.420
If you keep crying like that, you'll never make it home.

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:51.930
Yeah, I won't cry anymore.

