00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.180
How is it?

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.640
I'll give it a shot.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:42.230
You'll come too, won't you?

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:46.240
Yeah, I'll come too.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:55.030
Listen, Birk.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:02.210
I think, it would be really nice if you were my brother.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:10.260
If that's what you want, then I'm okay with it,

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:11.720
robber's daughter.

00:19:13.050 --> 00:19:15.390
It's what I want.

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:17.680
But...

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:24.020
only if you call me Ronja.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:29.570
Ronja,

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.650
my sister.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.780
You were in the forest for a while today.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.290
Were you doing well?

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.670
Yeah, pretty good.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:05.580
It's been a long time since it's snowed like this.

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:10.750
I can't remember the last time we got so much.

00:21:10.750 --> 00:21:17.840
If digging snow is what you like best, you're in for quite the happy season,

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.760
I promise you that.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.720
Don't say that!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:25.270
Your predictions always come true.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:30.400
They might come true this time too.

00:21:53.040 --> 00:21:54.000
No!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.260
How was it?

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:07.050
There was so much! I've never seen it like that before.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:16.610
Wolf's Neck is also buried under snow, huh?

00:22:17.430 --> 00:22:20.910
Nobody's going to be able to get through now.

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:22.870
Hell's Gap too.

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:24.580
I see.

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:28.160
Then there's no reason to place watchmen anymore.

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:33.670
See? The happy season came.

00:22:33.670 --> 00:22:35.670
Yeah!

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:38.850
Of course, that Borka is more stupid than a pig.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:45.350
But he's not quite so impossibly stupid as to want to fight in snow up to his armpits.

00:22:45.350 --> 00:22:48.180
This winter <i>has</i> been pretty bad, you know.

00:22:45.350 --> 00:22:46.560
That's right!

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:50.060
Wolf's Neck was in terrible condition.

00:22:49.270 --> 00:22:52.170
I'm sad I won't be on watchman duty.

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:08.870
Ronja!

